prompt:
Analyze the following article and return a 1 sentence description of its topic, a 1 paragraph narrative summary, a list of 3-5 key points (focusing primarily on factual claims), and a brief summary of the article’s political and reporting biases. 
        Return only in JSON with the following schema: 
        {“description”: string, “articlesummary”: string, “points”: list[string], “biassummary”: string}
